    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Realizing that the neighboring Italian restaurant, Arcobaleno, ordered the fake fire inspection, Dmitry decides to take revenge. He angrily calls the immigration service with a fake complaint against his rivals. Let us listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вы хотите войну?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Будет вам война.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Алло, добрый день.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "За что вам платят деньги?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
